# The minisign keypair for portable updates.
#
# The public half is `plugins.updater.pubkey` in src-tauri/tauri.conf.json; the
# private half signs every release. Losing the private half ends updates for
# every copy already installed, and leaking it lets anyone sign one that they
# will install.
#
# Everything here is ignored by default, so a blanket `git add` cannot pick the
# key up. Do not narrow this to individual file names.
*
!.gitignore
